Adapts pinned litmus7 output and startup for fixed-hart bare-metal execution.
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

Apply through the ordered series to build-local copies. Preserve generated test instructions,
outcome collection, sampling defaults, and the existing histogram format.

